Bucky watch app

Bucky is its own app, under the MIT License (see LICENSE). Two parts come from Bobby (github.com/pebble-dev/bobby-assistant),
Copyright 2025 Google LLC, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The license text is in
licenses/bobby-apache-2.0.txt.

- src/c/clock.c and src/c/clock.h are adapted from Bobby's alarm manager, with Bucky's own
  changes (names, timers, and the list the menus and timeline pins read).
- These icons are Bobby's, unchanged (Bobby's app/resources/icons/):
    resources/images/action_prompts.png   from question_icon.png
    resources/images/action_talk.png      from dictation_icon.png
    resources/images/action_menu.png      from more_icon.png
    resources/images/menu_alarms.png      from menu_alarms.png
    resources/images/menu_alarms~bw.png   from menu_alarms_bw.png
    resources/images/menu_timers.png      from menu_timers.png
    resources/images/menu_timers~bw.png   from menu_timers_bw.png

Everything else is Bucky's own: the rest of the code, the ringing icons (icon_*.png), and the
Bucky sprite and menu icon (sprite_*.png, menu_icon*.png), drawn for this app.

Billy (github.com/TomBolger/Billy, built from Bobby) and Bobby were inspiration for how Bucky
works and looks, such as the home screen, the example prompts on Up and the Alarms and Timers
menu. No code or art was taken from Billy.
